<title>UK: LGK sets $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>LGK sets $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESGIROKASSE OEFFENTLICHE BANK &amp; LANDESPARKASSE</p>
<p>(LGK)</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    21.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT APRIL 2002 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
